ave no entitlement to hardship payments in those circumstances. The date from which hardship payments can be awarded is decided under different rules from those for people in vulnerable groups\n1\n.  ","tree_line_end":582,"tree_line_start":572},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Note: See DMG 35055 for the meaning of vulnerable group for JSA hardship purposes. ","tree_line_end":588,"tree_line_start":583},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"1 JSA Regs, reg 142 & 146D  ","tree_line_end":595,"tree_line_start":589},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"35291  The DM should revise or supersede and end the award of hardship payments if the claimant ","tree_line_end":602,"tree_line_start":596},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"1.ceases to be a person or member of a couple in hardship or","tree_line_end":608,"tree_line_start":603},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"2.no longer satisfies other conditions of entitlement to JSA(IB).","tree_line_end":615,"tree_line_start":609},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":621,"tree_line_start":616},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":629,"tree_line_start":623},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":635,"tree_line_start":630},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":641,"tree_line_start":636},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Appendix 2.1 ","tree_line_end":648,"tree_line_start":642},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Claimant sanctioned - not in vulnerable group  ","tree_line_end":655,"tree_line_start":649},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":660,"tree_line_start":656},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":667,"tree_line_start":661},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":673,"tree_line_start":668},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"Is the period of sanction more than two weeks? ","tree_line_end":692,"tree_line_start":691},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"No entitlement to hardship payments ","tree_line_end":694,"tree_line_start":693},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"Does the claimant satisfy the other conditions of entitlement for JSA(IB)? ","tree_line_end":696,"tree_line_start":695},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"No entitlement to hardship payments ","tree_line_end":698,"tree_line_start":697},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"Will hardship occur if JSA is not paid? ","tree_line_end":700,"tree_line_start":699},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"No entitlement to hardship payments ","tree_line_end":702,"tree_line_start":701},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"Award hardship payments from the later of ","tree_line_end":704,"tree_line_start":703},{"depth":2,"role":"L","text":"1.the 15th day that JSA is notpayable because of the sanction or \n2.the date the claimant becomesa person in hardship. ","tree_line_end":711,"tree_line_start":705},{"depth":3,"role":"LI","text":"1.the 15th day that JSA is notpayable because of the sanction or ","tree_line_end":708,"tree_line_start":706},{"depth":3,"role":"LI","text":"2.the date the claimant becomesa person in hardship. ","tree_line_end":711,"tree_line_start":709},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"No ","tree_line_end":713,"tree_line_start":712},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"Yes ","tree_line_end":715,"tree_line_start":714},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"Yes ","tree_line_end":717,"tree_line_start":716},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"No ","tree_line_end":719,"tree_line_start":718},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"No ","tree_line_end":721,"tree_line_start":720},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"Yes ","tree_line_end":723,"tree_line_start":722},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":725,"tree_line_start":724},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":731,"tree_line_start":726},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":737,"tree_line_start":732},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":744,"tree_line_start":738},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":751,"tree_line_start":745},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":756,"tree_line_start":752},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":761,"tree_line_start":757},{"depth":1,"r